---
import GuideLayout from "@/layouts/GuideLayout.astro";
import { site } from "@/data/site";
---

<GuideLayout
  title="About Genesyx"
  description="Who is behind Genesyx, what the XX / XY preconception programme is for, and the evidence standard we hold ourselves to."
  eyebrow="About"
  type="page"
  summary={`Genesyx is a 90-day XX / XY preconception programme for couples who want to try the Shettles approach with a clear plan, safe products and honest information. It is run by ${site.legalName}, a UK company, alongside the free Genesyx companion app. Genesyx does not claim that any method can choose or guarantee a baby's sex.`}
  updated={new Date("2026-09-30")}
>
  <h2>What Genesyx is</h2>
  <p>
    Genesyx brings together the parts of the Shettles approach that couples usually piece together
    alone: a route-specific supplement formula, a nutrition guide, at-home vaginal pH and ovulation
    tests, and a companion app that shows your readings and timing window in one view. There are two
    routes: <a href="/xx">XX</a> for couples hoping for a girl and <a href="/xy">XY</a> for couples
    hoping for a boy.
  </p>

  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Honesty first.</strong> Research has not shown that timing, pH or diet reliably
      changes a baby's sex. We say so on every page, and our <a href="/evidence">evidence page</a>{" "}
      lists the studies.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Safety over hacks.</strong> We never recommend douching or home remedies to change
      vaginal pH.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Every outcome is welcome.</strong> Genesyx is a plan to follow together, not a
      promise.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    Genesyx is run by {site.legalName} (company number {site.companyNumber}), a UK company based in
    Ashford, Kent. The same team builds the Genesyx companion app, available free on the{" "}
    <a href={site.app.appStore}>App Store</a> and <a href={site.app.googlePlay}>Google Play</a>, and
    runs <a href="https://genesyx.co.uk/">genesyx.co.uk</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>How we keep content accurate</h2>
  <p>
    Every guide cites its sources and shows the date it was last updated. We review educational
    guides at least every 90 days and update them when guidance or research changes.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or see our{" "}
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</GuideLayout>
